        "text": "State Representative Nabeela Syed has served in the Illinois House since January 2023. She sponsored Senate Bill 3496, which passed the House and would create an independent board to set upper payment limits on certain prescription drugs. Her campaign says she would also cap out-of-pocket drug costs and expand mental health services.",
